    "where_global": "I don't really know alot about this place but most of my family are from toronto, and always come down to stay with us for holidays.",
    "where_aspirational": "I would love to go to jamaica for the pretty water that i would swim in, and when i have kids we will go there every summer or spring because its just so pretty and probably nice and warm. I would like to go to jamaica because i like how nice and pretty, blue, and crystal clear water is.",
