    "updated_at": "2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z",
    "where_personal": "The Personal Place Cit 9 WHERE [TABLE] MAP SCREENSHOT (from Bing Maps) / Reflection: This place is called Milford House. Since I was 3 years old my family, every summer drove roughly 2-3 hours, rented a cottage on a lake, and stayed there for up to a week. We would spend the days fishing and swimming, and the nights around a fire playing cards. They would serve 3 meals a day, and I would always get seafood chowder, which is very good. Guiding Questions: Not far from the cottages, is where the previous owners used to live. They were very kind and would always give gifts to me and my sister, mostly stuffed animals. They were very kind and would always help employ people in need. / [PICTURE] [PICTURE]",
    "where_community": "The Community Place [TABLE] MAP SCREENSHOT / Reflection: The place i chose is East Coast Varsity. It is a sports dome of which people play soccer, football, lacrosse, and baseball. I chose this place because it is where i spent years learning the sport i love. Year after year, no matter the time, I always end up there. / Cit 9 WHERE [PICTURE] [PICTURE]",
    "where_global": "The Global Place [TABLE] MAP SCREENSHOT / Reflection: The place I chose is england. I chose england because I have family in Brighton, and my family immigrated from London. My grandfather and grandmother, had flown to Canada from London England, started a new life, and have lived on to love canada. My cousins are from brighton England. Every couple of years we fly out and live with my cousins for a week or two and it’s always really fun. / Cit 9 WHERE [PICTURE] [PICTURE]",
    "where_aspirational": "The Aspirational Place [TABLE] MAP SCREENSHOT / Reflection: I’ve always wanted to go to Hawaii. The main reasons I’ve wanted to go is because of the beaches. I hear the water is perfectly clear. I think it would be a great time to get a beach resort and spend the days playing in the water. / Cit 9 WHERE [PICTURE] [PICTURE]",
