    "cat4_aspirational": "The Aspirational Place [TABLE] MAP SCREENSHOT / Reflection: I’ve always wanted to go to Hawaii. The main reasons I’ve wanted to go is because of the beaches. I hear the water is perfectly clear. I think it would be a great time to get a beach resort and spend the days playing in the water. / Cit 9 WHERE [PICTURE] [PICTURE]",
    "cat5_music": "The Aspirational Place \n[TABLE]   The song I choose is country roads, by John Denver. /     /   Every time I hear this song I think of camping at Rissers beach. When I was 5 my parents took me camping and we listened to this song all the way there. Every time I hear this song I think about that camping trip. We played cards, threw a ball and had a great time \nCit 9  WHERE",
    "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uu7j_xljCRY",
